      "control_id": "CTL.SQS.POLICY.GHOSTREF.001",
      "control_name": "SQS Queue Policy Must Not Reference Deleted Principals",
      "control_description": "SQS queue policies must not grant access to principal ARNs that don't exist in the IAM inventory. A recreated principal matching the ghost ARN inherits SendMessage (injection) or ReceiveMessage (interception) access. Resource-based policies evaluate ARN strings, not unique IDs.\n",
